direction: down
title: GPTpatient modernization · Data Turn

// Data records, authority boundaries and retention.
d01: PostgreSQL is the application system of record { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
d02: Tenant · user · role · entitlement · quota records { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
d03: Immutable versioned PatientScenarioSeed and hidden answer key { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
d04: Append-only PatientFactExpansion ledger with source and turn ID { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
d05: Append-only disclosure ledger with disclosed fact IDs { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
d06: Encounter snapshot: phase · mode · status · current turn { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
d07: Coverage: pertinent topics asked · relevant · missing { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
d08: Orders: order time · status · fixed result reference { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
d09: Exams: consent · decline · chaperone · mode · completion { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
d10: Assessment: learner summary · differential · rationale · plan { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
d11: Event ledger: ordered append-only turns · actions · phase changes { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
d12: Transcript: speaker · timestamp · phase · modality · turnId { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
d13: Mark expansion epistemic source as patient-reported or seeded / verified { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
d14: Patient-reported statement cannot become a lab or exam result { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
d15: Results and findings resolve only from fixed scenario catalog { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
d16: Record schema · prompt · model · rubric versions for replay { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
d17: Keep answer key hidden until authorized instructor or debrief { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
d01 -> d02 -> d03 -> d04 -> d05 -> d06 -> d07 -> d08 -> d09 -> d10 -> d11 -> d12 -> d16 -> d17
d04 -> d13
d13 -> d14: patient-reported history
d13 -> d15: seeded / verified

// One serialized text turn: authorize, validate, commit, then deliver.
t01: Learner types text or uses browser speech recognition { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t02: Generate client turnId / idempotency key { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t03: "POST /api/sessions/:sessionId/turns { turnId, text }" { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t04: Authenticate cookie · tenant · session owner · turn entitlement { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t05: Runtime-validate request body and text limits { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t06: Acquire per-session turn lock { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t07: Check committed turnId in idempotency ledger { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t08: Return same committed patient reply for duplicate turn { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t09: Validate current phase and selected interaction mode { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t10: Reject invalid phase or concurrent active turn { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t11: Keep clinician input in turn context until atomic commit { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t12: Load only this session's authorized model projection { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t13: Add phase · relevant seed facts · accepted expansions { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t14: Add disclosure boundaries · fixed personality · coverage state { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t15: Add pinned prompt · schema · model · policy versions { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t16: Call Responses with stored conversationId and current input { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t17: Do not also send previous_response_id { shape: text; style.fill: "#FFFFFF"; style.stroke: "#172B45"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t18: Inspect refusal · incomplete · timeout · provider error { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t19: Queue safe provider-failure audit asynchronously; do not invent reply { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t20: Validate structured patient utterance and proposed expansions { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t21: Check seed · prior facts · chronology · age plausibility { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t22: Check obstetric outcomes · parity · child count · complications { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t23: Protect diagnosis · deterministic results · rubric · disclosure rules { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t24: Retry against same saved patient profile { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t25: Queue validation-failure audit asynchronously after bounded retries { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t26: Prepare safe clarification when output remains invalid { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t27: Begin Redis live-state and event-stream transaction { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t28: Update accepted patient-reported facts in RedisJSON { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t29: Append disclosure events to Redis Stream { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t30: Append patient reply · input · turn-complete event { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t31: Append phase and audit events for background workers { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t32: Commit live state · reply · retry key · recovery event together { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t33: On Redis commit failure, return no unjournaled reply { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t34: Return reply without waiting for PostgreSQL { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t35: Is optional TTS enabled? { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t36: Stream speech synthesis separately { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t37: Wait until reply and enabled playback complete { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t38: Release lock and allow next learner turn { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
t01 -> t02 -> t03 -> t04 -> t05
t05 -> t10: invalid request
t05 -> t06: valid request
t06 -> t10: lock unavailable
t06 -> t07: lock acquired
t07 -> t08: duplicate committed turn
t07 -> t09: new turn
t09 -> t10: phase / mode disallows turn
t09 -> t11: permitted
t11 -> t12 -> t13 -> t14 -> t15 -> t16 -> t17 -> t18
t18 -> t19: refused / incomplete / failed
t18 -> t20: usable response
t20 -> t21: valid output shape
t20 -> t24: invalid shape; retry allowed
t21 -> t22: consistent
t21 -> t24: conflict or impossible chronology
t22 -> t23: coherent outcomes
t22 -> t24: inconsistent obstetric arithmetic
t23 -> t27: authorized facts only
t23 -> t24: unauthorized diagnosis / result / disclosure
t24 -> t16: retry remains
t24 -> t25: retries exhausted
t25 -> t26 -> t27
t27 -> t28 -> t29 -> t30 -> t31 -> t32
t32 -> t33: transaction fails
t32 -> t34: committed
t34 -> t35
t35 -> t36: enabled
t35 -> t37: disabled
t36 -> t37 -> t38
